WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:05.140
The Octavia is one of Skoda's most successful
vehicle ranges

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:08.240
and includes the sporty RS models.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:12.880
Recently the Octavia underwent a facelift
and we're going to test its mettle.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:18.280
Our tester Michelle Assenmacher says she's
going to test the Octavia RS

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.179
at a driver safety training center.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:21.920
And she knows it'll be fun!

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:31.240
That's largely thanks to the car's turbo diesel
engine, which churns out 135 kilowatts of power.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:37.540
It propels the new Octavia RS to a top speed
of 230 kilometers an hour, and lets it to

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:41.400
go from 0 to 100 kilometers an hour in
7.9 seconds.

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:45.740
Our test model sells for around 33-and-a-half
thousand euros in Germany.

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:51.960
The slalom course isn't the only part of the
test site that's under water.

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:58.220
In a flooded roundabout, Michelle tries to
get the Skoda Octavia RS to stay on track.

00:00:58.220 --> 00:00:59.400
That's harder than 
it looks....

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:11.660
"Okay, I give up", she says -- and leaves
this part to the professionals....

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.940
This is what it looks like with a trained
pro behind the wheel!

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:39.840
But Michelle says she's game to tackle this
slalom course.....

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:48.560
The Octavia's RS models -- badged as vRS in
some markets -- have a 15 millimeter lower

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:50.440
sport suspension.

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:54.950
Other features that add to their sportiness
include progressive steering and optional

00:01:54.950 --> 00:02:00.960
Dynamic Chassis Control which lets drivers
choose between Sport, Normal and Comfort modes.

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:11.180
Inside, Michelle shows us one of Skoda's 'Simply
Clever' solutions that can be found in the Octavia RS.

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:15.620
She can open this water bottle with just one
hand, drink from it

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:20.280
and close it again, while

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:22.600
keeping one hand on the steering wheel.

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:28.620
The new front looks masculine and sporty.

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:34.100
Full-LED headlights, set on either side of
the radiator grille, make the car appear wider.

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:39.340
The hood and the sharper lines at the sides
give the car an 'edgier' look.

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:46.000
At the back, the rear spoiler adds a sporty
accent.

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:53.810
The abbreviation 'RS' stands for 'racing sport'.

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:58.579
RS variants made their way into the Skoda
range in the year 2000.

00:02:58.579 --> 00:03:03.029
Since then these sporty models have won over
more and more fans.

00:03:03.029 --> 00:03:06.480
Skoda's Octavia RS has proved particularly
popular.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:12.040
Michelle says she likes taking tight curves
with it best.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:16.360
The car whines and roars....and it's just....Wow!

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:21.499
It's a driving experience that you simply
have to experience for yourself.

00:03:21.499 --> 00:03:25.219
It's incredible, because the car is so
good on curves.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.980
And that literally leaves Michelle speechless!

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:39.719
All in all, the RS's facelift has done more
than just spruce up its outer appearance.

00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:42.390
Changes have been made inside as well.

00:03:42.390 --> 00:03:47.260
The result is a sporty sedan, which has certainly
put a smile on our tester's face.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.760
Michelle says she's had lots of fun today.

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:58.760
She could leave the traffic behind and push
the Octavia RS to its limits.

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:03.230
Though she admits it was more HER limits that
were being tested, because in the hands of

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:06.309
the pros the car can definitely do more.

00:04:06.309 --> 00:04:09.290
She thinks the Octavia RS is a good mix.

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:13.280
It's fun, as she found out today, and good
for everyday use

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:16.140
thanks to its 'Simply Clever' solutions.

